      "scope_description": "a private specialist outpatient clinic (the Skin and Joint Injection Clinic) providing musculoskeletal joint and soft-tissue injections (including ultrasound-guided corticosteroid and hyaluronic acid injections), minor surgery (skin lesion excision, punch biopsy, cryotherapy), dermatology assessment and treatment, and diagnostic musculoskeletal ultrasound",
